**Resolving the ApexMocks API surface definitively.** Since the deploy failed, I must strip my API usage down to only what I can vouch for in the real `fflib_ApexMocks.cls` (v1.x–v3.x, the version deployed alongside fflib-apex-common in virtually every org):

