**Assumptions:**
- “All seven events” = before insert, before update, before delete, after insert, after update, after delete, after undelete. Fulfilment is started on after insert and after update only (the only events where an insert-to-won / transition-to-won can occur).
- A delete of an already-won opportunity must not trigger fulfilment (deletes are handled by the domain but qualify nothing).
- Undelete of a previously-won opportunity is treated like a new save into “Closed Won” and qualifies (it is a new successful save whose stage is won).

